<title>USA: IPO FILING-Peak International Ltd.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING-Peak International Ltd.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Peak International Ltd</p>
<p>Stock symbol			PITLF.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $12-$14/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    3.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 3.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    13,461,538</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Donaldson Lukfin &amp; Jenrette</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  450,000 shrs Business: Based in Hong Kong, Peak is a supplier of precision engineered packaging products for the storage, transporation and automated handling of semiconductor devices and other electronic components.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: Net proceeds will be used to repay bank laons. Balance of proceeds will be used to fund planned capital expenditures.</p>
</text>
